{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "App—服务边界的共享合成 fixture。只记录公共 wire 事件与稳定字段：不含真实音频、用户文本、绝对路径或凭据。`server_events` 由 tests/test_assistant_realtime_lifecycle_fixture.py 通过真实 /v1/realtime WebSocket + fake backend 观测得到；macos 侧由 AssistantRealtimeLifecycleFixtureTests.swift 消费同一份事件驱动生产 AssistantSession。任一侧的时序变化都必须先重录本文件，两侧断言因此不会各自漂移。逐事件 id（event_id/session_id/task_id/plan_id）与逐 utterance id（item_id）在两侧都归一化成占位符，只断言它们的类型、顺序与互不相同。",
  "volatile_fields": [
    "event_id",
    "session_id",
    "task_id",
    "plan_id"
  ],
  "omitted_event_types": [
    "speechrail.tts.audio.delta"
  ],
  "omitted_event_types_reason": "audio.delta 的载荷是 Base64 PCM。项目规则禁止 fixture 记录原始音频/Base64，所以它不写进本文件；两侧测试改为断言「这些被省略的类型确实出现过且顺序符合预期」，而不是把它们从观测里悄悄丢掉。",
  "sequence_semantics": "每条事件的 sequence 是 wire 上真实分配的序号，因此在被省略的事件处保留跳号（例如 long_reply 的 completed 是 9 不是 8）。序号连续性由服务端侧测试单独断言。",
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "id": "barge_in_closure",
      "covers": [
        "D01",
        "D06",
        "D08",
        "B02",
        "B05"
      ],
      "summary": "增量 TTS 正在播放时用户打断：App 停本地播放并发 cancel，服务端不必等音频准入队列就回终态，终态之后立即发起的下一轮 start 必须被准入（B05 终态屏障），且第二轮同样恰好一个 terminal。",
      "client_script": [
        "session.update(tts.enabled=true)",
        "tts.start(request_id=req_barge)",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=0, text=好的，)",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=1, text=我停下了)",
        "tts.cancel(request_id=req_barge)",
        "tts.start(request_id=req_next)",
        "tts.cancel(request_id=req_next)"
      ],
      "server_events": [
        {
          "type": "session.created",
          "sequence": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "session.updated",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.started",
          "request_id": "req_barge",
          "limits": {
            "max_append_codepoints": 512,
            "max_total_codepoints": 4096,
            "max_pending_codepoints": 2048,
            "max_pending_audio_bytes": 48000
          },
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_barge",
          "append_sequence": 0,
          "accepted_codepoints": 3,
          "total_codepoints": 3,
          "sequence": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_barge",
          "append_sequence": 1,
          "accepted_codepoints": 4,
          "total_codepoints": 7,
          "sequence": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.cancelled",
          "request_id": "req_barge",
          "sequence": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.started",
          "request_id": "req_next",
          "limits": {
            "max_append_codepoints": 512,
            "max_total_codepoints": 4096,
            "max_pending_codepoints": 2048,
            "max_pending_audio_bytes": 48000
          },
          "sequence": 6
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.cancelled",
          "request_id": "req_next",
          "sequence": 7
        }
      ],
      "app_expectation": {
        "assistant_rows": [
          {
            "text": "好的，我停下了",
            "interrupted": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "app_inputs": {
        "reply_deltas": [
          "好的，",
          "我停下了"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "long_reply",
      "covers": [
        "D11",
        "B04",
        "B07"
      ],
      "summary": "回复里独立空格、换行与连续空白都是合法增量：tts.started 回带收紧后的生效 limits（B07 全链路一致），每个 append 恰好一个 ACK，append_sequence 从 0 连续递增，total_codepoints 单调累加且把纯空白批次如实计入（B04/D11 的 wire 侧证据），finish_text 后恰好一个 completed。App 侧 D11 的断言落在**落库正文**上：raw_reply_text 必须等于五个增量的原样拼接（含 \\n 与连续空格）；tts_appended_text 是同一条文本经 VoicePrompt.spokenText 清洗后的结果（行折叠、空格收敛），这是产品有意保留的朗读清洗层，不是空白丢失。",
      "client_script": [
        "session.update(tts.enabled=true)",
        "tts.start(request_id=req_long, limits.max_pending_codepoints=1024)",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=0, text=Hello)",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=1, text=' ')",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=2, text='world\\n')",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=3, text='  ')",
        "tts.append_text(sequence=4, text=再见)",
        "tts.finish_text(request_id=req_long, last_sequence=4)"
      ],
      "server_events": [
        {
          "type": "session.created",
          "sequence": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "session.updated",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.started",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "limits": {
            "max_append_codepoints": 512,
            "max_total_codepoints": 4096,
            "max_pending_codepoints": 1024,
            "max_pending_audio_bytes": 48000
          },
          "sequence": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "append_sequence": 0,
          "accepted_codepoints": 5,
          "total_codepoints": 5,
          "sequence": 3
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "append_sequence": 1,
          "accepted_codepoints": 1,
          "total_codepoints": 6,
          "sequence": 4
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "append_sequence": 2,
          "accepted_codepoints": 6,
          "total_codepoints": 12,
          "sequence": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "append_sequence": 3,
          "accepted_codepoints": 2,
          "total_codepoints": 14,
          "sequence": 6
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.text_accepted",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "append_sequence": 4,
          "accepted_codepoints": 2,
          "total_codepoints": 16,
          "sequence": 7
        },
        {
          "type": "speechrail.tts.completed",
          "request_id": "req_long",
          "sequence": 9
        }
      ],
      "app_expectation": {
        "raw_reply_text": "Hello world\n  再见",
        "tts_appended_text": "Hello world 再见",
        "assistant_rows": [
          {
            "text": "Hello world\n  再见",
            "interrupted": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "app_inputs": {
        "reply_deltas": [
          "Hello",
          " ",
          "world\n",
          "  ",
          "再见"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "input_packetization",
      "covers": [
        "D09",
        "B01",
        "B03",
        "B06"
      ],
      "summary": "第一句整包 64 ms 发送，第二句按 1/7/1/5/2 帧的不齐切片发送：分包粒度不改变内容，两句各自恰好一个 completed、item_id 互不相同、commit_event_id 原样回显（B01/B03），两个 ASR session 都被回收（B06）。",
      "client_script": [
        "input_audio_buffer.append(frames=1536)",
        "input_audio_buffer.commit(event_id=evt-c1)",
        "input_audio_buffer.append(frames=1)",
        "input_audio_buffer.append(frames=7)",
        "input_audio_buffer.append(frames=1)",
        "input_audio_buffer.append(frames=5)",
        "input_audio_buffer.append(frames=2)",
        "input_audio_buffer.commit(event_id=evt-c2)"
      ],
      "server_events": [
        {
          "type": "session.created",
          "sequence": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "conversation.item.input_audio_transcription.completed",
          "item_ref": "<item:0>",
          "content_index": 0,
          "transcript": "第一句",
          "commit_event_id": "evt-c1",
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "conversation.item.input_audio_transcription.completed",
          "item_ref": "<item:1>",
          "content_index": 0,
          "transcript": "第二句",
          "commit_event_id": "evt-c2",
          "sequence": 2
        }
      ],
      "app_expectation": {
        "user_rows": [
          {
            "text": "第一句",
            "has_created_at": true,
            "t_start_is_null": true,
            "t_end_is_null": true
          },
          {
            "text": "第二句",
            "has_created_at": true,
            "t_start_is_null": true,
            "t_end_is_null": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "app_inputs": {
        "user_transcripts": [
          "第一句",
          "第二句"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "reconnect_recovery",
      "covers": [
        "D02",
        "D03",
        "D04",
        "B06",
        "B08"
      ],
      "summary": "同一条连接上先用未注册的 model 提交 session.update：候选配置在发布前被拒，只回一个 model_not_found 错误，不产生 session.updated；随后同一条连接上的合法更新照常成功，session_id 不变（B08 原子发布 + 连接仍然可用）。",
      "client_script": [
        "session.update(model=no-such-registered-model, event_id=evt-bad-update)",
        "session.update(event_id=evt-good-update)"
      ],
      "server_events": [
        {
          "type": "session.created",
          "sequence": 0
        },
        {
          "type": "error",
          "request_id": "evt-bad-update",
          "error": {
            "type": "invalid_request_error",
            "code": "model_not_found",
            "message": "unknown model: no-such-registered-model"
          },
          "sequence": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "session.updated",
          "sequence": 2
        }
      ],
      "app_expectation": {
        "same_record_after_retry": true,
        "record_count_after_retry": 1,
        "history_preserved": true
      },
      "app_inputs": {
        "rejected_update_code": "model_not_found"
      }
    }
  ]
}
